  "privacySubtitle": "Privacy and service policy • Updated 7 November 2026",
  "privacyNotice": "We want your experience to be clear and safe for everyone. This page explains the main points for both sides.",
  "privacyDataHeading": "Your data and visit address",
  "privacyDataBody": "We use your name, service details and visit address to coordinate a request. Before a request is accepted, only the information needed to check the service area and appointment is used. Your contact details are shared only as needed to arrange the visit.",
  "privacyPhotosHeading": "Work photos",
  "privacyPhotosBody": "Uploading photos is optional. Photos can help explain the issue or show examples of completed work. Share only images relevant to the request, and avoid including private documents or unrelated personal information. Photos are not used for advertising in this sample policy.",
  "privacyBookingHeading": "Bookings and inspection fees",
  "privacyBookingBody": "Sending a request does not mean the booking is confirmed. Wait for the service provider to accept it. Any inspection fee should be shown before you submit the request. Repair work or spare parts are not included unless their price is clearly agreed in advance.",
  "privacyResponsibilitiesHeading": "Customer and service provider responsibilities",
  "privacyResponsibilitiesBody": "The customer should describe the issue accurately and provide safe access to the place or device. The service provider should confirm the agreed price and appointment before starting work. If a disagreement or service problem occurs, contact support so the team can help.",
  "privacyCancellationHeading": "Changes and cancellation",
  "privacyCancellationBody": "You can request a cancellation before the service visit. For a nearby appointment or a provider delay, contact support to arrange an alternative. No additional fee should be charged without being explained and approved in advance.",
  "privacyRetentionHeading": "Data retention, deletion and support",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "Some request records may need to be kept to resolve disputes or meet legal requirements. You can contact support to ask what data is held or request deletion where permitted. Open Help and support from your account to ask a question.",
